        "text": "Charting the frontier road: Hatysa, Ridgecrest, Cervantes, Miaplacidus, Mimosa, Electra, Tau Ceti, Alpha Centauri, Sol, Sirius, Nova Terra, Furud, now Acrux. Mining where the rocks allow. Exploration is the score tonight."
